# Cline — Lens Design System

Read first:  .lens-knowledge-base/AGENT_PRIMER.md
Navigate:    .lens-knowledge-base/_ROUTER.md
Declare:     Sources consulted: [files] in every UI response

If request conflicts with rules: refuse · explain · propose Lens alternative

## Cline-Specific Quick Reference

| Wrong | Correct |
|-------|---------|
| div Box | Container |
| Flex display:flex div | Split |
| Grid display:grid div | Arrange |
| h1 h2 p span | Text (+ htmlTag for semantics) |
| disabled loading | isDisabled hasLoader |
| as="a" | htmlTag="a" |
| ref={ref} | refHandler={(r) => ref.current = r} |
| leftIcon rightIcon | iconBefore iconAfter |
| raw SVG | Icon icon={<SvgName />} |
| raw input | TextInput inside FormField |

Never load:
  .lens-knowledge-base/reference/components-full.md
  .lens-knowledge-base/reference/styles-full.md